{"reviewId": "230585179_869dnuVT6", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "原油：工业血液，强周期资产，反映实际经济需求、通胀预期、能源供给\n黄金：终极避险 / 抗通胀资产，无利息，反映实际利率、美元信用、风险溢价\n金油比：本质是风险偏好 vs 增长预期、实际利率 vs 通胀预期的综合相对定价指标\n油金比极低：原油相对极贵，黄金相对极便宜。需求爆发，通胀高，一般在繁荣期；2001-2007\n油金比偏高：黄金偏强，原油偏弱。经济危机避险资金涌向黄金，同时繁荣期原油产能过剩，一般发生在衰退期；\n油金比极高：黄金相对极贵，原油相对极便宜。需求萎缩，资金避险，产能等待出清，一般发生在萧条期；\n油金比偏低：原油价格回升，黄金避险功能下降。一般发生在回升期。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "8706-8723", "abstract": "黄金原油价格比率一直围绕着中枢波动", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "230585179_869dnuVT6", "userVid": 230585179, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768373992, "userEditTime": 1768375758, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 230585179, "name": "Jerry", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0009-5r0e36ypfsBhd3oQaqsMm10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "山止川行", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 105, "likes": [{"userVid": 396932050, "name": "🌄", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/icFTnRoibgibpicYuYZ07SNrQibiaHbvDjZ39K3FtWbq49V6hrFAcTaELsd3D7hE2EEj81mdh6XLIULUw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "🌄", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "也许未来会用金电比代替金油比", "reviewId": "230585179_869dnuV